msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:49
#: eb68576012734249afa5e612c2b87ec6
msgid "The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:51
#: b95a187a3d8e41979f1b112af7c6eb04
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL5 (UART8) would need to be used for receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial5."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:54
#: e103fc17693f4c939bc35b8012b1b8f8
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>`  should be set to “23”."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:55
#: 84ab70a9eb5a4d69bd8e2c06c3157b81
msgid "CRSF would require  :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>`  set to “0”."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:56
#: 84e99f7410c64f0ca08b039d1bd4ebca
msgid "SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` set to “4”. And only connect the TX pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:58
#: a1e52774b49a4d88af5e2f03f87c3bd7
msgid "The SBUS_IN pin is internally tied to the RCIN pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:60
#: 11d110936f42431ab20d6af21e9c7aa1
msgid "Any UART can also be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems <common-rc-systems>` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:63
#: 0d7307f1b7a647d0a35dc66da670869d
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:64
#: 06498e3e32b94f3f916bf28975d98ffd
msgid "The SULILLGH7-P1/P2 flight controller supports up to 16 PWM outputs. First 8 outputs (labelled 1 to 8) are controlled by a dedicated STM32F103 IO controller. The remaining 8 outputs (labelled 9 to 16) are the \"auxiliary\" outputs. These are directly attached to the STM32H753 FMU controller. All 16 outputs support normal PWM output formats. All 16 outputs support DShot, except 15 and 16."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:69
#: 3f9ab53c74074a8aaf2d0c108403d2ba
msgid "The 8 IO PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:72
#: 4657bc7a7a2e4c9fb3bb8cf43506c3c1
msgid "Outputs 1 and 2 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:73
#: e3025c58de3a49038ec391fc07a8e8e6
msgid "Outputs 3 and 4 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:74
#: 3f61a5fb761f40e6b92d4e7256acd8d6
msgid "Outputs 5, 6, 7 and 8 in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:76
#: 3378df7126fc4f2baa8bcc0ce0857d58
msgid "The 8 FMU PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:79
#: 333f161443f1487a92298b1124dc563f
msgid "Outputs 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:80
#: d7060c019ebd45e08aad0e7d4380780d
msgid "Outputs 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:81
#: 6c8d1b989b474feeaf102b864f5f62d2
msgid "Outputs 7 and 8 in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-suligh7.rst:83
#: acde02ab438d43d0ad642e6564003415
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

